---
name: phase-4-plan
description: The plan phase sub-workflow of the plan unit.
type: subworkflow
icon: phase.plan
entry: start
exit: execute
exit: land
exit: rework
exit: returned
modification_date: 2026-01-15
version: 0.1.0
author: plan-marshall
---
# The plan phase (Phase 4) as its own unit, written for the invariant and unit-loader tests, never copied from the
# product. Every path into Phase 5 passes the derivation, plan.qgate and the composition; the blocking verdict of
# plan.qgate calls the Q-Gate remediation. The phase is shared by both lanes after outline.gate, so its rework leaves
# the phase on the `rework` exit, which the plan unit turns into a call of outline's rework entry — the authoring entry
# every lane keeps (the light lane through its escalation), never a state of the light route.
workflow phase-4-plan version 1 format 1
scope subworkflow
entry start -> plan.derive

state plan.derive
    auto test.proceed
        done -> plan.qgate

state plan.qgate
    auto test.qgate
        pass -> plan.compose
        blocking -> plan.remediate

state plan.remediate
    call remediation.qgate-findings(retry_budget = 2, fix_budget = 2, waiver_wait_seconds = 3600, actions = [retry, fix])
        resolved -> plan.compose
        waived -> plan.compose
        exhausted -> plan.return-exit
        fix_requested -> plan.rework-exit
        stepped_out -> plan.return-exit

state plan.compose
    auto test.route
        execute -> plan.execute-exit
        land -> plan.land-exit

state plan.execute-exit terminal execute success

state plan.land-exit terminal land success

state plan.rework-exit terminal rework success

state plan.return-exit terminal returned failure
